      {
        "location": "Bit-20 final block and rails",
        "evidence": "Enlarged original-source crop shows 3308E1 N block at printed grid 4M, with B07 input and D06 output. A diamond at B07 branches the 3M B04 signal to the -IND ROS BIT 20 FQ PARITY edge. The D06 output crosses that rail without a diamond, then joins the lower +ROS REG BIT 20 rail at its printed diamond. Normal 4M lattice position retained."
