      {
        "location": "Right edge -ROS DATA LTH BIT 18",
        "evidence": "Native print starts with a short downward hook immediately left of the 7-bank output vertical; no diamond joins the crossing. The visible source is an open hook, so the rail is retained as a separate printed continuation with unresolved electrical origin."
